{
	"info": {
		"name": "Decidesk Board Portal API Contract Suite",
		"description": "Newman/Postman API-contract tests for the decidesk **board-portal** controller family (Phase 1-6 of `openspec/changes/board-meeting-resolutions/`). Locks the HTTP contract of `appinfo/routes.php`'s board-portal block: Board CRUD, BoardMember invite/role/remove, BoardMeeting schedule/notice/lifecycle, Resolution propose/amend/openVote/conclude, BoardVote cast/tally/audit, RegulatorExport generate/list, and MultilingualReconciliation queue/status/process. Board/BoardMember/BoardMeeting/Resolution/BoardVote CRUD is delegated to the OpenRegister object API (ADR-022); decidesk owns the guarded governance endpoints documented above.\n\nAUTH MODEL (mirrors decidesk.postman_collection.json): collection auth is noauth; every authenticated request carries an EXPLICIT basic-auth block (admin:admin via adminUser/adminPass) plus the 'OCS-APIRequest: true' header (NC app-framework controllers reject session-less POSTs without it as a CSRF failure). The no-auth requests carry NEITHER, and target {{noAuthBase}} (127.0.0.1) so the host-scoped NC session cookie established by authed localhost requests never leaks to them.\n\nCONTRACT COVERAGE per endpoint family: happy path (2xx), validation/error path (4xx, never 500), authorization path (anonymous -> 401 on user-gated endpoints, anonymous -> 401 on admin-gated endpoints). RegulatorExport + MultilingualReconciliation are explicitly admin-gated by their controllers (#[NoAdminRequired] + manual IGroupManager::isAdmin check) so anonymous callers receive 401, non-admin callers would receive 403 — admin-suite covers the 401 form.\n\nSelf-contained + idempotent: setup creates a Board, an admin BoardMember, a BoardMeeting, and a Resolution; teardown deletes everything; run again to repeat.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
		{ "key": "noAuthBase", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8080" },
		{ "key": "adminUser", "value": "admin" },
		{ "key": "adminPass", "value": "admin" },
		{ "key": "register", "value": "decidesk" },
		{ "key": "boardId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "boardMemberId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "boardMeetingId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "resolutionId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "voteId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "minutesId", "value": "" }
	],
	"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "0. Setup",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Seed Board",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Setup: board created (2xx)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
									"const b = pm.response.json();",
									"const board = b.board || b;",
									"const id = (board['@self'] && board['@self'].id) || board.id || board.uuid;",
									"pm.expect(id, 'board id captured').to.be.a('string');",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('boardId', id);"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "basic", "basic": [ { "key": "username", "value": "{{adminUser}}", "type": "string" }, { "key": "password", "value": "{{adminPass}}", "type": "string" } ] },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "OCS-APIRequest", "value": "true" } ],
						"body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Newman Supervisory Board\",\n  \"type\": \"raad-van-commissarissen\",\n  \"governanceModel\": \"two-tier\"\n}" },
						"url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/index.php/apps/decidesk/api/boards", "host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ], "path": [ "index.php", "apps", "decidesk", "api", "boards" ] }
					}
